Does this mapping diagram represent a function?
[tikz]
\begin{tikzpicture}[every node/.style={font=\large}]
\draw (0,0) ellipse (0.8 and 2);
\draw (3.4,0) ellipse (0.8 and 2);
\node at (0,2.35) {$x$};
\node at (3.4,2.35) {$y$};
\node (L0) at (0,1.3) {$1$};
\node (L1) at (0,0) {$4$};
\node (L2) at (0,-1.3) {$7$};
\node (R0) at (3.4,1.3) {$0$};
\node (R1) at (3.4,0) {$3$};
\node (R2) at (3.4,-1.3) {$6$};
\draw[->] (L0)--(R1);
\draw[->] (L1)--(R0);
\draw[->] (L2)--(R2);
\end{tikzpicture}
[/tikz]

